F1: Synthetic Description="Cloud Storage",
OriginalDescription="CLOUDBOX*STORAGE PLAN CLOUDBOX.COM CA",
Category="Electronics & Software": three monthly $25 outflows.
The brief requires Cloud Storage true; design requires recognizing the demo.
classification.go:20-26 selects the original description, whose bank descriptor
is unrecognized. Friendly-description-only worker fixtures miss this case.

F2: Synthetic Description="AutoLoan Finance",
OriginalDescription="AUTOLOAN FINANCE BILL PMT", Category="Auto Payment":
three monthly $25 outflows. The design requires loans in recurring bills.
classification.go:30,35 recognizes neither this category nor AUTOLOAN as
the two-word "auto loan" phrase.
Both are classification gaps, not missing rows or understated all-recurring totals.
Exact fixtures were obtained from checker-second's verdict after the lead
reported its findings; this checker independently ran the reproduction above.
